   Q('mcq', 'What is Maya\'s main criticism of the Kimberley Process?', 'C', 'its definition of a conflict diamond is very narrow', 'The definition is too narrow.', opts=['It is too expensive for small countries.', 'Few countries have joined it.', 'It defines conflict diamonds too narrowly.']),
